"brew tap-info --installed --json. Official taps in API mode are read from Homebrew's API and aren't tapped. Trust is brew 7's (brew trust --tap): \"Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.\" Tankard never runs brew untap --force." = "brew tap-info --installed --json. Los taps oficiales en modo API se leen desde la API de Homebrew y no están en un tap. La confianza es la de brew 7 (brew trust --tap): \"Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.\" Tankard nunca ejecuta brew untap --force.";
"brew tap-info printed something Tankard couldn't read." = "brew tap-info imprimió algo que Tankard no pudo leer.";
